  "title": {
    "rendered": "እንኳን ደስ አላችሁ!"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>እማማ ዘውዲቱ አንድ ተጨማሪ ልጅ በስርዓተ ቤተክርስቲያን ዳሩ<br />\nእማማ ዘውዲቱ በግቢያቸው ከዚህ በፊት 22 ልጆችን ድረው የነበረ ሲሆን ይህ አሁን የዳሩት ልቻቸው እንዳልካቸው መኮንን 23 ሆኖ የተዳረ ነው</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-914\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-300x254.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-300x254.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-768x650.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-24x20.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-36x30.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1-48x41.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/photo_2022-02-26_09-38-28-1.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>እማማ ዘውዲቱ አንድ ተጨማሪ ልጅ በስርዓተ ቤተክርስቲያን ዳሩ እማማ ዘውዲቱ በግቢያቸው ከዚህ በፊት 22 ልጆችን ድረው የነበረ ሲሆን ይህ አሁን የዳሩት ልቻቸው እንዳልካቸው መኮንን 23 ሆኖ የተዳረ ነው</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
